		{
			dependencies: ["6AF9FD70EB5A15AB"]
			description: [
				"&ePneumaticCraft&r runs on &opressure&r rather than Forge Energy, and it is the only mod in this chapter where over-pressurising a machine makes it explode. Watch the gauges."
				""
				"Start with an &eAir Compressor&r burning solid fuel and &ePressure Tube&r to distribute it. Everything downstream - the charging station, the assembly line, the drones - drinks from this."
			]
			icon: "pneumaticcraft:air_compressor"
