		{
			dependencies: ["7A4291CCD32CAFEF"]
			description: [
				"The &eProgrammer&r is the best-looking automation UI in the pack, and the most fun."
				""
				"You drag &opuzzle pieces&r into a program - &7go to area&r, &7dig block&r, &7place block&r, &7pick up item&r, &7craft&r, &7harvest&r - and snap them together into a flight plan. No syntax, no text, just shapes that fit or don't."
				""
				"Build the program here. The thing that runs it comes next."
			]
			icon: "pneumaticcraft:programmer"
