		{
			dependencies: ["164AB36A0A638226"]
			description: [
				"Slot a program into a &eDrone&r, give it a &eCharging Station&r to sip pressure from, and let it go."
				""
				"It will fly out and do the job - farm a field, clear an area, ferry items between chests, chase mobs off the island - and come home to recharge. No pipes, no cables, no channels. Just a small machine that knows what you asked for."
				""
				"&7Specialised drones exist too: Harvesting, Logistics, Collector and Guard drones come pre-programmed if you'd rather skip the jigsaw."
			]
